  "long_description": "Framebase is programmatic video.\r\n\r\nWriting applications which use video in a meaningful way is extremely difficult. And then there's the maintenance.\r\n\r\nFramebase makes video a first-class object. Instead of hiring a team to deal with transcoding configurations, device compatibility bugs, or CDN contracts, Framebase lets you add two lines of code to start treating videos as class instances.\r\n\r\nFramebase is a pivot of TapIn.tv, which is a Y Combinator S 2012 company.",
